         <section class="scc-news news-list">
            <div class="scc-news-inner"><div class="scc-news-1col"><div class="snc">		<h2 class="heading-border-bottom heading-border-red mb-30 hide-on-desktop">SCC News</h2>		<a href="/news/2026/great-tastes-fundraiser-set-for-friday-november-6.aspx"><img loading="lazy" src="/_resources/images/news/2026/great-tastes-2025-thumb.jpg" alt="Three women holding glasses smiling" /></a></div><div class="snc">	<div class="hentry">		<h2 class="heading-border-bottom heading-border-red mb-30 hide-on-mobile">SCC News</h2>		<h3 class="entry-title"><a href="/news/2026/great-tastes-fundraiser-set-for-friday-november-6.aspx" class="news-title">Great Tastes Fundraiser Set for Friday, November 6</a></h3>		<div class="news-date meta"><time class="updated" datetime="9/22/2026 12:00:00 AM">09/22/2026</time></div>	<div class="entry-content">		<p>The annual Southeastern Community College Foundation (SCCF) Great Tastes event is scheduled for Friday, November 6, at the Great River Event Center in Burlington. <a href="/news/2026/great-tastes-fundraiser-set-for-friday-november-6.aspx" class="readmore-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="scc-news-2col mt-50"><div class="scc-news-2col-inner hentry">	<div class="snc"><a href="/news/2026/great-tastes-fundraiser-set-for-friday-november-6.aspx"><img loading="lazy" src="/_resources/images/news/2026/great-tastes-2025-thumb.jpg" alt="Three women holding glasses smiling" /></a>		</div><div class="snc">		<h3 class="entry-title"><a href="/news/2026/great-tastes-fundraiser-set-for-friday-november-6.aspx" class="news-title">Great Tastes Fundraiser Set for Friday, November 6</a></h3>		<div class="news-date meta"><time class="updated" datetime="9/22/2026 12:00:00 AM">09/22/2026</time></div>		<div class="entry-content">		<p>The annual Southeastern Community College Foundation (SCCF) Great Tastes event is scheduled for Friday, November 6, at the Great River Event Center in Burlington. <a href="/news/2026/great-tastes-fundraiser-set-for-friday-november-6.aspx" class="readmore-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></div></div><div class="scc-news-2col-inner hentry">	<div class="snc"><a href="/news/2026/scc-welcomes-dr-jennifer-sabourin-as-vice-president-of-student-affairs.aspx"><img loading="lazy" src="/_resources/images/news/2026/dr-jennifer-sabourin-thumb.jpg" alt="Dr. Jennifer Sabourin" /></a>		</div><div class="snc">		<h3 class="entry-title"><a href="/news/2026/scc-welcomes-dr-jennifer-sabourin-as-vice-president-of-student-affairs.aspx" class="news-title">SCC Welcomes Dr. Jennifer Sabourin as Vice President of Student Affairs</a></h3>		<div class="news-date meta"><time class="updated" datetime="7/29/2026 12:00:00 AM">07/29/2026</time></div>		<div class="entry-content">		<p>Southeastern Community College has named Dr. Jennifer Sabourin as its new Vice President of Student Affairs. Sabourin brings more than 20 years of experience in higher education and will lead the college's student services division. <a href="/news/2026/scc-welcomes-dr-jennifer-sabourin-as-vice-president-of-student-affairs.aspx" class="readmore-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></div></div></div>
               <div class="scc-btn text-center mt-40"><a href="/news/" class="btn btn-red-bg">View All</a></div>
            </div>
         </section>
         	</main>
